3. CURATED DATA

   The object descriptions, agency attributions, researched category verdicts,
   photograph selections, and highlight lists distributed with the Software —
   including apps/web/public/data/descriptions.json, neo-descriptions.json,
   photos.json, hotlist.json, and packages/catalog/src/reclassify.js — are
   original works of authorship, compiled through manual research. They are
   not derived from, and are not redistributable under the terms of, the
   public catalogues credited in README.md. They are covered by this Licence
   in full.

   The underlying orbital elements and source material obtained from CelesTrak,
   NASA/JPL, NASA, and The Space Devs remain subject to those providers' own
   terms, and nothing in this Licence asserts any claim over them.

4. BACKEND SERVICES

